omenon":"动作跑偏","cause":"舵机中位未标定，先写一遍中位标定再录动作序列。","repo":"dance-robot-esp32","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/dance-robot-esp32"},{"n":4,"phenomenon":"eyes 屏幕白屏","cause":"SPI 频率过高或引脚定义不匹配，降到 20 MHz 先验证。","repo":"dance-robot-esp32","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/dance-robot-esp32"},{"n":5,"phenomenon":"torch.cuda.is_available() 为 False","cause":"装的是 CPU 版，装 GPU 版需 pip install torch --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu121。","repo":"dl-pytorch-course","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/dl-pytorch-course"},{"n":6,"phenomenon":"中文路径报错","cause":"Windows 下 Dataset 的 num_workers>0 与中文路径有兼容问题，先把 num_workers 设为 0。","repo":"dl-pytorch-course","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/dl-pytorch-course"},{"n":7,"phenomenon":"显存不足","cause":"先把 batch size 减半，再考虑混合精度。","repo":"dl-pytorch-course","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/dl-pytorch-course"},{"n":8,"phenomenon":"matplotlib 中文变方块","cause":"plt.rcParams['font.sans-serif']=['SimHei']。","repo":"dl-pytorch-course","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/dl-pytorch-course"},{"n":16,"phenomenon":"烧录失败","cause":"按住 BOOT 再上电进入下载模式。","repo":"esp32-k230-ai","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/esp32-k230-ai"},{"n":17,"phenomenon":"ESP32 反复重启","cause":"多为供电不足（摄像头/舵机同时工作时尤其明显），改用外部 5V 并共地。","repo":"esp32-k230-ai","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/esp32-k230-ai"},{"n":18,"phenomenon":"K230 帧率低","cause":"降低分辨率或关闭显示叠加；sensor.set_framesize 改 QVGA 先验证链路。","repo":"esp32-k230-ai","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/esp32-k230-ai"},{"n":19,"phenomenon":"串口乱码","cause":"波特率不匹配或 TX/RX 未交叉；K230 端注意 3.3V 电平。","repo":"esp32-k230-ai","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/esp32-k230-ai"},{"n":24,"phenomenon":"报错找不到 FreeRTOS.h","cause":"确认 Options for Target → C/C++ → Include Paths 含 Middlewares/FreeRTOS/include；工程路径不要有中文/空格。","repo":"freertos-labs","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/freertos-labs"},{"n":25,"phenomenon":"烧录提示 Cannot access target","cause":"检查 SWD 四线接触与供电；J-Link 在 Options → Debug → Settings 里选 SW、速度降到 1 MHz 重试。","repo":"freertos-labs","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/freertos-labs"},{"n":26,"phenomenon":"动态创建任务返回 errCOULD_NOT_ALLOCATE_REQUIRED_MEMORY","cause":"在 User/FreeRTOSConfig.h 调大 configTOTAL_HEAP_SIZE（模板默认值适合 10 个以内小任务）。","repo":"freertos-labs","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/freertos-labs"},{"n":27,"phenomenon":"中文注释乱码","cause":"Keil Edit → Configuration → Encoding 改为 UTF-8。","repo":"freertos-labs","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/freertos-labs"},{"n":32,"phenomenon":"高频率下波形失真","cause":"DAC 采样点不足，提高 TIM 触发频率或降输出频率。","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/lissajous-figure-device"},{"n":33,"phenomenon":"K230 识别偏差大","cause":"镜头斜拍或屏幕反光，先正对采集并固定曝光。","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/lissajous-figure-device"},{"n":34,"phenomenon":"图形抖动/相位漂","cause":"两路未同源触发，或 DAC 更新时刻不对齐。","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/lissajous-figure-device"},{"n":35,"phenomenon":"圆变成扁椭圆","cause":"X/Y 通道增益不匹配，用同一幅值标准源分别标定。","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/lissajous-figure-device"},{"n":43,"phenomenon":"图片全黑","cause":"路径相对当前工作目录，先 cd 到脚本所在目录再跑。","repo":"opencv-basics","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/opencv-basics"},{"n":44,"phenomenon":"颜色异常","cause":"BGR/RGB 混用，显示前 cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.COLOR_BGR2RGB)。","repo":"opencv-basics","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/opencv-basics"},{"n":45,"phenomenon":"cv2 找不到","cause":"装的是 opencv-python-headless（无 GUI），换装 opencv-python。","repo":"opencv-basics","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/opencv-basics"},{"n":46,"phenomenon":"中文路径 imread 返回 None","cause":"用 cv2.imdecode(np.fromfile(path, np.uint8), cv2.IMREAD_COLOR)。","repo":"opencv-basics","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/opencv-basics"},{"n":47,"phenomenon":"读数周期性跳变","cause":"量程在边界来回切，先看回差逻辑，或把激励幅值调入下一档的舒适区。","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/RLC_dac_study_flash"},{"n":48,"phenomenon":"相位偏差大且随频率漂","cause":"未做全频段相位校准；用纯电阻在扫频下逐点标定。","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/RLC_dac_study_flash"},{"n":49,"phenomenon":"低频段读数不稳","cause":"1024 点窗口内周期数太少，降低起始频率或加窗（Hanning）。","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/RLC_dac_study_flash"},{"n":50,"phenomenon":"USB 无串口","cause":"先装 ST 官方 VCP 驱动，再确认 _08_USB 已初始化。","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/RLC_dac_study_flash"},{"n":51,"phenomenon":"keilkilll.bat 用途","cause":"清理残留 Keil 进程，下载异常时先跑一遍。","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/RLC_dac_study_flash"},{"n":61,"phenomenon":"HAL_project 与同名 lab 的配置对不上","cause":"前者是标准库写法、后者是 CubeMX 生成的 HAL 写法，时钟使能与中断配置的初始化顺序本就不同，对照看差异即可。","repo":"stm32-cubemx-labs","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32-cubemx-labs"},{"n":62,"phenomenon":"重新生成代码后自己的修改没了","cause":"CubeMX 会整段覆盖 Core/ 里的生成区，业务代码放 User/ 或写在 /* USER CODE BEGIN */ 区间内，重新生成前先提交一次。","repo":"stm32-cubemx-labs","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32-cubemx-labs"},{"n":63,"phenomenon":"Keil 打开报缺器件包","cause":"装对应系列的 Keil.STM32F4xx_DFP（其他系列换对应包）；CubeIDE 用户可忽略这一条。","repo":"stm32-cubemx-labs","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32-cubemx-labs"},{"n":64,"phenomenon":"编译报缺 CMSIS 头文件","cause":"各 lab 重复的 CMSIS 副本已在提交 91daec0d 移除，缺的工程按 ST 官网对应版本补回，不要整份拷回仓库。","repo":"stm32-cubemx-labs","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32-cubemx-labs"},{"n":65,"phenomenon":"AD9959 无输出","cause":"先确认 CS/SCLK/SDIO0-3/IO_UPDATE/P0-P3 引脚与板级定义一致，再查 SPI 分频（建议 ≤10 MHz）。","repo":"stm32f4-projects","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32f4-projects"},{"n":66,"phenomenon":"中文文件名导致 Keil 报错","cause":"目录名含中文时，Keil 5 在部分系统上会无法打开工程，可临时改为英文目录再编译。","repo":"stm32f4-projects","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32f4-projects"},{"n":67,"phenomenon":"编译找不到头文件","cause":"Options → C/C++ → Include Paths 里补 _03_Drive、_04_FWLib 子目录；路径避免中文。","repo":"stm32f4-projects","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32f4-projects"},{"n":68,"phenomenon":"下载失败 / 芯片被锁","cause":"Keil Flash → Configure Flash Tools → Debug → Settings 里把 J-Link 速度降到 1 MHz，必要时用 ST-Link Utility 全片擦除。","repo":"stm32f4-projects","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32f4-projects"},{"n":82,"phenomenon":"下载后无显示","cause":"先确认 LTDC 时钟（LTDC 像素时钟）与 SDRAM 是否初始化成功，可用串口打印 HAL_LTDC_Init 返回值定位。","repo":"stm32h7-projects","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32h7-projects"},{"n":83,"phenomenon":"HardFault","cause":"多为 MPU 配置或 Cache 关闭顺序问题，先关 D-Cache 验证。","repo":"stm32h7-projects","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32h7-projects"},{"n":84,"phenomenon":"LVGL 花屏","cause":"显存对齐与 stride 不匹配，检查 lv_conf.h 的颜色格式和缓冲区大小。","repo":"stm32h7-projects","section":"5. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/stm32h7-projects"},{"n":85,"phenomenon":"综合报找不到 IP","cause":"IP 目录（*.xci）未随仓库同步，先在 Vivado 里重新生成 IP。","repo":"zynq-fpga-projects","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/zynq-fpga-projects"},{"n":86,"phenomenon":"下载后无现象","cause":"确认约束文件里的引脚与板子原理图一致，特别是 LED/按键的 bank 电压。","repo":"zynq-fpga-projects","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/zynq-fpga-projects"},{"n":87,"phenomenon":"时序不收敛","cause":"小工程一般不会，若出现先检查未约束的跨时钟路径。","repo":"zynq-fpga-projects","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/zynq-fpga-projects"},{"n":88,"phenomenon":"工程打不开提示版本不符","cause":"Vivado 版本差异导致，用高版本打开后重新 Generate。","repo":"zynq-fpga-projects","section":"4. 常见问题","url":"https://github.com/xhtfps/zynq-fpga-projects"}],"usages":[{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"freertos-labs","path":"00_freertos_project_template/Drivers/BSP/AD9959/AD9959.c","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"freertos-labs","path":"00_freertos_project_template/Drivers/BSP/AD9959/AD9959.h","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","path":"F题_李萨如控制装置_F407/Drivers/BSP/AD9959/AD9959.c","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","path":"F题_李萨如控制装置_F407/Drivers/BSP/AD9959/AD9959.h","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","path":"F题_李萨如控制装置_F407/Drivers/BSP/AD9959/Drive_AD9959.c","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","path":"F题_李萨如控制装置_F407/Drivers/BSP/AD9959/Drive_AD9959.h","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ads1256","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","path":"F题_李萨如控制装置_F407/Drivers/BSP/ADS1256/ADS1256.c","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ads1256","repo":"lissajous-figure-device","path":"F题_李萨如控制装置_F407/Drivers/BSP/ADS1256/ADS1256.h","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","path":"_03_Drive/Drive_AD9959.c","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","path":"_03_Drive/Drive_AD9959.h","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ads1256","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","path":"_03_Drive/Drive_ADS1256.c","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ads1256","repo":"RLC_dac_study_flash","path":"_03_Drive/Drive_ADS1256.h","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"stm32f4-projects","path":"基地调试程序/AD DA+AD9959+ADS1256+iha6958h/_03_Drive/Drive_AD9959.c","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ad9959","repo":"stm32f4-projects","path":"基地调试程序/AD DA+AD9959+ADS1256+iha6958h/_03_Drive/Drive_AD9959.h","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ads1256","repo":"stm32f4-projects","path":"基地调试程序/AD DA+AD9959+ADS1256+iha6958h/_03_Drive/Drive_ADS1256.c","kind":"source"},{"driver_id":"ads1256","repo":"stm32f4-projects","path":"基地调试程序/AD DA+AD9959+ADS1256+iha6958h/_03_Drive/Drive_ADS1256.h","kind":"sou